---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Shipping Policy">
  <h1>Shipping Policy</h1>
  <p>We process all orders within 2–3 business days.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Free U.S. shipping</strong> on orders over $50.</li>
    <li>Flat rate of $5.95 for orders under $50.</li>
    <li>Tracking information will be emailed once your order ships.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>If you have special shipping requests, contact us at <strong>hello@rootedsmile.com</strong>.</p>
</BaseLayout>
